AWS Enterprise Readiness
Bringing our AWS environment up to the same enterprise standard as our matured Azure Gov Cloud footprint, built 100% as Infrastructure-as-Code in Terraform. Also partnering with another team to migrate their existing AWS resources under this managed Terraform baseline, consolidating governance and reducing configuration drift across the org.

GitHub Actions Runner Modernization
Migrating our years-old, Summerwind-based self-hosted runner deployment to the officially supported Actions Runner Controller (ARC) scale set model, including automated runner image builds. This puts us on a vendor-supported path, improves security posture, and reduces the maintenance burden of a deprecated toolchain.

Enterprise Container Image Scanning Pipeline
Building a reusable image scanning capability that plugs directly into CI/CD, positioned for enterprise-wide adoption. Gives us consistent vulnerability detection before images ever reach production, and a single control point for security policy across teams.
